    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238650/extras/5032ade7ed6a29b7cfd2887c5d773aad.avif?t=1730524549\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>OG Memory: Synthwave Vampires</strong> is an memory game with scary Vampires in an stunning synthwave style. You have to find the same correct pairs to completle the game in as few rounds as possible. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find all of the pairs to get a new try and beat your record.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >24 cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >nice retro/ synthwave experience\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100 achievments to reach</p></li></ul>",
